<title>JAPAN: Daiwa House - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Daiwa House - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.19 trln	 vs	    1.07 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   74.90		vs	   68.13</p>
<p> Current	     76.63		vs	   69.97</p>
<p> Net		   42.45		vs	   38.99</p>
<p> EPS		   82.76 yen	  vs	   80.91 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 79.89 yen	  vs	   77.66 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiwa House Industry Co Ltd is a builder of steelframe homes.</p>
